{%- comment -%}
  Upsell tiles on the v2 product page (under the sizes, above Add to Cart).

  Driven by product metafields on the main product:
  - custom.upsell_variants             list of variants: piece n of a set is choice n (a 2-piece set
                                        = two different products, e.g. socks + beanie). No pickers are
                                        shown: use one-size products; a sized product silently gets
                                        the size closest to the main product's size.
  - custom.upsell_labels               optional display names, same order (e.g. "Merino cycling
                                        socks", "Under-helmet cap"); empty = product title
  - custom.upsell_backups_1 / _2       optional backups for piece 1 / piece 2, in order of
                                        preference. When the piece (every size of it) is sold out,
                                        the first in-stock backup takes its place on the tiles, in
                                        the cart and in the discount (e.g. the Neckwarmer for the
                                        skull cap, another colour for the Merino sock). A backup
                                        from another product shows its own title, not the label.
  - custom.upsell_discount_percentages [10, 20]: discount on 1 piece, on 2 pieces, ...;
                                        the list's length is the maximum quantity offered
  - custom.upsell_label                short name on the tiles (empty = product title)
  - custom.upsell_default_qty          optional: the tile selected on load (0 = main product only,
                                        1 = first bundle tile, ...); default = the last (best value) tile
  - custom.upsell_title                optional: title of the largest set (empty = translated
                                        "Complete winter set"); custom.upsell_title_small for the
                                        smaller sets (empty = "Winter set"). Under it: one line per
                                        product ("Plus <sock>" / "+ <beanie>")

  Tile 0 is the main product alone; tile n adds n pieces of the add-on. Each tile
  shows the main product's photo + n photos of the add-on; the first add-on
  tile carries "Most popular", the last "Best value". Choosing a tile shows
  one size picker per piece when the add-on has more than one size. Add to Cart first adds the add-on pieces with the
  line attribute _upsell_for = the main product's gid, then the main product.
  The "Upsell discount" function (apps/theme-backup-ci, extensions/upsell-discount)
  gives those lines the percentage from the metafield while the main product is
  in the cart. Prices on the tiles are computed in the browser from the variant
  prices, so they follow the selected variant of the main product.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign upsell = nil
  assign upsell_choices = product.metafields.custom.upsell_variants.value
  assign upsell_label_list = product.metafields.custom.upsell_labels.value
  comment
    The choices, as JSON for the script and as lists of photo urls and titles
    for the tiles (choice n is the default for piece n).
  endcomment
  assign choices_json = ''
  assign choice_imgs = ''
  assign choice_labels = ''
  assign upsell_guides = ''
  assign guide_ids = ''
  if upsell_choices != blank
    for v in upsell_choices
      comment
        Piece n is choice n. When it is sold out (every size of it), the first
        in-stock backup from custom.upsell_backups_n takes its place.
      endcomment
      assign piece = v
      capture piece_ok
        render 'product-upsell-variant-usable', variant: v
      endcapture
      assign piece_ok = piece_ok | strip
      if piece_ok != 'y'
        assign backups_key = 'upsell_backups_' | append: forloop.index
        assign backups = product.metafields.custom[backups_key].value
        if backups != blank
          for b in backups
            capture backup_ok
              render 'product-upsell-variant-usable', variant: b
            endcapture
            assign backup_ok = backup_ok | strip
            if backup_ok == 'y'
              assign piece = b
              break
            endif
          endfor
        endif
      endif
      if piece.product.available == false
        continue
      endif
      if forloop.first
        assign upsell = piece.product
      endif
      capture one
        render 'product-upsell-choice-json', variant: piece
      endcapture
      if choices_json != ''
        assign choices_json = choices_json | append: ','
      endif
      assign choices_json = choices_json | append: one
      assign img = piece.image | default: piece.product.featured_image
      assign choice_imgs = choice_imgs | append: img | image_url: width: 96 | append: '|'
      comment
        a sized add-on (gloves, overshoes) gets its own size guide pop-up, keyed by the choice index
      endcomment
      assign piece_sized = false
      for popt in piece.product.options_with_values
        assign popt_name = popt.name | downcase
        if popt_name contains 'size' or popt_name contains 'maat' or popt_name contains 'größe' or popt_name contains 'grootte' or popt_name contains 'taille' or opt_name contains 'grootte' or opt_name contains 'taille'
          if popt.values.size > 1
            assign piece_sized = true
          endif
        endif
      endfor
      if piece_sized
        assign guide_id = 'size-guide-overlay-upsell-' | append: forloop.index
        capture guide_modal
          render 'size-guide-modal', product: piece.product, overlay_id: guide_id
        endcapture
        assign upsell_guides = upsell_guides | append: guide_modal
        assign guide_ids = guide_ids | append: guide_id | append: '|'
      else
        assign guide_ids = guide_ids | append: '|'
      endif
      assign custom_label = upsell_label_list[forloop.index0]
      if piece.product.id != v.product.id
        comment
          a backup from another product is named after itself
        endcomment
        assign custom_label = blank
      endif
      if custom_label != blank
        assign choice_labels = choice_labels | append: custom_label | append: '|'
      else
        assign choice_labels = choice_labels | append: piece.product.title | append: '|'
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  assign choice_imgs = choice_imgs | split: '|'
  assign choice_labels = choice_labels | split: '|'
  assign guide_ids = guide_ids | split: '|'
  assign upsell_pcts = product.metafields.custom.upsell_discount_percentages.value
  assign upsell_label = product.metafields.custom.upsell_label | default: upsell.title
  assign upsell_default_qty = product.metafields.custom.upsell_default_qty.value | default: upsell_pcts.size
  if upsell_default_qty > upsell_pcts.size
    assign upsell_default_qty = upsell_pcts.size
  endif
  comment
    Tile titles: the last (largest) set is the "complete" one, the smaller sets
    get the short name. Both can be overridden per product.
  endcomment
  assign upsell_title_full = product.metafields.custom.upsell_title | default: nil
  if upsell_title_full == blank
    assign upsell_title_full = 'products.v2.upsell_set_title_full' | t
  endif
  assign upsell_title_small = product.metafields.custom.upsell_title_small | default: nil
  if upsell_title_small == blank
    assign upsell_title_small = 'products.v2.upsell_set_title' | t
  endif
  comment
    Black Friday mode (theme settings > Black Friday): a black header tile above the
    tiles (title, message, countdown on the right) and "Black Friday offer" on every
    set tile instead of "Most popular" / "Best value". Tile titles stay as they are.
  endcomment
  assign tile_badge_popular = 'products.v2.upsell_badge_popular' | t
  assign tile_badge_value = 'products.v2.upsell_badge_value' | t
  if settings.bf_enabled
    capture bf_offer_badge
      render 'bf-text', key: 'offer_badge'
    endcapture
    if bf_offer_badge != blank
      assign tile_badge_popular = bf_offer_badge
      assign tile_badge_value = bf_offer_badge
    endif
  endif
  comment
    Free-shipping threshold of the market (same rule as the shipping row):
    tiles whose total reaches it show "Free shipping".
  endcomment
  assign ship_threshold = settings.free_shipping
  if cart.currency.iso_code == 'USD'
    assign ship_threshold = settings.free_shipping_usd | default: 100
  endif
  assign host_size = ''
  for opt in product.options_with_values
    assign opt_name = opt.name | downcase
    if opt_name contains 'size' or opt_name contains 'maat' or opt_name contains 'größe' or opt_name contains 'grootte' or opt_name contains 'taille'
      assign host_size = opt.selected_value
    endif
  endfor
-%}
{%- if upsell != blank and choices_json != '' and upsell_pcts.size > 0 -%}
  {{ 'pdp-upsell.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  {%- if settings.bf_enabled -%}{{ 'bf.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}{%- endif -%}
  <div class="pdp-upsell" data-pdp-upsell data-host-gid="gid://shopify/Product/{{ product.id }}" data-form="{{ product_form_id }}" data-label="{{ upsell_label | escape }}" data-url="{{ upsell.url }}" data-money="{{ cart.currency.symbol | default: '€' }}" data-host-size="{{ host_size | escape }}" data-host-options='{{ product.options | json }}' data-ship-threshold="{{ ship_threshold }}" data-piece-labels="{{ choice_labels | json | escape }}" data-default-size="{{ settings.upsell_default_size | escape }}" data-size-label="{{ 'products.v2.upsell_size_label' | t: label: '__LABEL__' | escape }}" data-most-chosen="{{ 'products.v2.upsell_most_chosen' | t | escape }}" data-size-guide="{{ 'products.v2.size_guide_link' | t | escape }}" data-guide-ids="{{ guide_ids | json | escape }}">
    {%- if settings.bf_enabled -%}
      <div class="pdp-upsell__bf">
        <span class="pdp-upsell__bf-text">
          {%- capture bf_pdp_title -%}{%- render 'bf-text', key: 'pdp_title' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- capture bf_pdp_message -%}{%- render 'bf-text', key: 'message' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          <span class="pdp-upsell__bf-title">{{ bf_pdp_title | escape_once }}</span>
          {%- if bf_pdp_message != blank -%}<span class="pdp-upsell__bf-sub">{{ bf_pdp_message | escape_once }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        </span>
        {%- render 'bf-countdown', class: 'pdp-upsell__bf-timer' -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="pdp-upsell__tiles" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ 'products.v2.upsell_group' | t: label: upsell_label }}">
      <button type="button" class="pdp-upsell__tile{% if upsell_default_qty == 0 %} is-selected{% endif %}" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if upsell_default_qty == 0 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-qty="0">
        <span class="pdp-upsell__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="pdp-upsell__img" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 96 }}" alt="" width="32" height="32" data-upsell-host-img>
        </span>
        <span class="pdp-upsell__text">
          <span class="pdp-upsell__title">{{ 'products.v2.upsell_only' | t: product: product.title }}</span>
          <span class="pdp-upsell__ship" data-upsell-ship hidden>{{ 'products.v2.upsell_free_shipping' | t }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="pdp-upsell__price">
          <span class="pdp-upsell__total" data-upsell-total>{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money }}</span>
          <s class="pdp-upsell__compare" data-upsell-compare></s>
          <span class="pdp-upsell__saving" data-upsell-saving><span data-upsell-saving-text>{{ 'products.v2.upsell_you_save' | t: amount: '__AMOUNT__' }}</span></span>
        </span>
      </button>
      {%- for pct in upsell_pcts -%}
        <button type="button" class="pdp-upsell__tile{% if upsell_default_qty == forloop.index %} is-selected{% endif %}" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if upsell_default_qty == forloop.index %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-qty="{{ forloop.index }}" data-pct="{{ pct }}">
          {%- if forloop.index == 1 -%}
            <span class="pdp-upsell__badge{% if settings.bf_enabled %} pdp-upsell__badge--bf{% endif %}">{{ tile_badge_popular }}</span>
          {%- elsif forloop.last -%}
            <span class="pdp-upsell__badge{% if settings.bf_enabled %} pdp-upsell__badge--bf{% endif %}">{{ tile_badge_value }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="pdp-upsell__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="pdp-upsell__img" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 96 }}" alt="" width="32" height="32" data-upsell-host-img>
            <span class="pdp-upsell__plus">+</span>
            {%- for i in (1..forloop.index) -%}
              {%- assign ci = i | minus: 1 -%}
              {%- if ci >= choice_imgs.size -%}{%- assign ci = choice_imgs.size | minus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- if i > 1 -%}<span class="pdp-upsell__plus pdp-upsell__plus--piece">+</span>{%- endif -%}
              <img src="{{ choice_imgs[ci] }}" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="lazy" data-upsell-piece-img="{{ i | minus: 1 }}">
            {%- endfor -%}
          </span>
          <span class="pdp-upsell__text">
            <span class="pdp-upsell__title">{% if forloop.last %}{{ upsell_title_full }}{% else %}{{ upsell_title_small }}{% endif %}</span>
            {%- if choice_labels.size > 1 -%}
              {%- comment -%} different products per piece: name them, e.g. "Plus Merino socks + Beanie" {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- assign items = '' -%}
              {%- for i in (1..forloop.index) -%}
                {%- assign ci = i | minus: 1 -%}
                {%- if ci >= choice_labels.size -%}{%- assign ci = choice_labels.size | minus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if items != '' -%}{%- assign items = items | append: '<br>+ ' -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- assign items = items | append: choice_labels[ci] -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
              {%- comment -%} the line break must survive the translation filter's escaping {%- endcomment -%}
              <span class="pdp-upsell__sub">{{ 'products.v2.upsell_add_list' | t: items: '__ITEMS__' | replace: '__ITEMS__', items }}</span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="pdp-upsell__sub">{{ 'products.v2.upsell_add' | t: count: forloop.index, label: upsell_label }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="pdp-upsell__ship" data-upsell-ship hidden>{{ 'products.v2.upsell_free_shipping' | t }}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="pdp-upsell__price">
            <span class="pdp-upsell__total" data-upsell-total></span>
            <s class="pdp-upsell__compare" data-upsell-compare></s>
            <span class="pdp-upsell__saving" data-upsell-saving><span data-upsell-saving-text>{{ 'products.v2.upsell_you_save' | t: amount: '__AMOUNT__' }}</span></span>
          </span>
        </button>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    {{ upsell_guides }}
    <script type="application/json" data-upsell-choices>[{{ choices_json }}]</script>
    <script type="application/json" data-host-variants>
      [{%- for v in product.variants -%}{ "id": {{ v.id }}, "price": {{ v.price }}, "compare": {{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 }}, "options": {{ v.options | json }} }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%}]
    </script>
  </div>
  <script src="{{ 'pdp-upsell.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  {%- if settings.bf_enabled -%}<script src="{{ 'bf-countdown.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
